Disclaimer
----------

PharmaSee CMC Workbench is a draft and knowledge workbench. It does NOT
replace QA, RA, QP, or SME professional judgment. Outputs are drafts for
controlled review only — not GMP-controlled documents. The workbench must
not be used to fabricate batch data, specifications, validation results,
or regulatory conclusions.

Regulatory knowledge is a local snapshot, not a live database. Verify
current requirements against official agency and pharmacopoeial sources
before relying on any output.
